Example 1: AS-IS input

```stan
data {
  int<lower=0, upper=1> y;
}
parameters {
  real<lower=0, upper=1> theta;
}
model {
  theta ~ beta(1, 1);
  y ~ bernoulli(theta);
}
```

```json
{"y": 1}
```

Example 1 output shape

