- `minor`: a same-posterior SafeStan version can be produced using only minor, mechanical, changes. Return new, rewritten `model_safe_stan` equivalent to the original and `data_safe_json` equivalent to the supplied data.
- `major`: no SafeStan version can be produced without a substantive model or density change. In this case return empty strings for `model_safe_stan` and `data_safe_json`.

